{"id": "f45538cda5e8ceedc84dfe2b33c9dbab", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale/riyadh", "title": "Properties for Sale in Riyadh — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt lists a wide range of properties for sale in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia. Property types available include apartments, villas, townhouses, duplexes, floors, and land plots. Riyadh districts covered include Al Olaya, Al Malqa, Al Nakheel, Al Yasmeen, Al Shohada, Al Rawdah, Al Sahafa, Hittin, Al Narjis, and Al Qirawan. Prices for apartments typically start from SAR 300,000, while villas range from SAR 800,000 upward depending on size and location. Property sizes range from studios to 7-bedroom villas. Amenities commonly listed include private parking, security, swimming pool, gym, and maid's room.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Riyadh, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "d43ebca22ab4488bbc5db27e588d67b6", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale/jeddah", "title": "Properties for Sale in Jeddah — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt features extensive property listings for sale in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia. Available property types include seafront apartments, luxury villas, duplexes, and commercial spaces. Key districts in Jeddah include Al Shati, Al Hamra, Al Rawdah, Al Zahraa, Al Faisaliah, Obhur Al Shamaliyah, and Al Basateen. Jeddah waterfront and Red Sea view properties are among the most sought after. Apartment prices in Jeddah start from approximately SAR 250,000 for standard units and reach several million SAR for luxury seafront properties. Villas in premium districts can exceed SAR 5 million.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Jeddah, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "fae4e36a5ec475bef1b82e9769ca70c0", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-rent/riyadh", "title": "Properties for Rent in Riyadh — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt offers thousands of verified rental listings in Riyadh. Studio apartments rent from approximately SAR 15,000 per year. One-bedroom apartments range from SAR 20,000 to SAR 45,000 annually. Two-bedroom apartments range from SAR 30,000 to SAR 70,000. Three-bedroom villas start at SAR 60,000 per year. Premium compound villas in areas like Al Malqa and Hittin can reach SAR 250,000 or more annually. Listings include details on floor level, view, parking spaces, and proximity to schools and shopping centres.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Riyadh, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "e03f2768a00e84ae27b37b5f985b2760", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-rent/jeddah", "title": "Properties for Rent in Jeddah — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt features rental listings throughout Jeddah. Furnished and unfurnished apartments are available across all major districts. Annual rents for a one-bedroom apartment range from SAR 18,000 to SAR 50,000. Family villas for rent in Jeddah typically range from SAR 70,000 to SAR 200,000 per year. Listings specify whether utilities are included, provide GPS coordinates, and display REGA license numbers. Wasalt also lists short-term furnished apartments for temporary stays.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Jeddah, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "371f006e2c171fcf8a8ceb2805cc91d1", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale", "title": "Villa Listings Saudi Arabia — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt is one of Saudi Arabia's leading platforms for villa listings. Villas are available for sale and rent across the Kingdom. Standard features include 3 to 7 bedrooms, private gardens, driver's room, maid's room, rooftop terraces, and private swimming pools in premium listings. Locations span Riyadh, Jeddah, Dammam, Khobar, Mecca, Medina, and Tabuk. Compound villas offer shared amenities such as clubhouses, gyms, children's play areas, and 24-hour security. New-build and off-plan villa projects are frequently listed on Wasalt.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "d13bfab00109b907ca44a2877ece0684", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale", "title": "Apartment Listings Saudi Arabia — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt lists thousands of apartment units for sale and rent in Saudi Arabia. Studio apartments, one-bedroom, two-bedroom, three-bedroom, and four-bedroom and larger configurations are all available. Apartments are listed in towers, low-rise buildings, and residential compounds. Key amenities mentioned in listings include concierge services, fitness centres, rooftop pools, covered parking, and smart home features. The platform categorises listings by new-build, resale, and off-plan. Property sizes range from under 60 sqm for studios to over 300 sqm for large premium apartments.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "9c08d1db25ed30e460f66166fe6c20a6", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale/dammam", "title": "Dammam and Eastern Province Properties — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt covers property listings in Dammam, Al Khobar, Dhahran, Qatif, and the broader Eastern Province. The Eastern Province is an important economic hub due to oil and gas industry presence. Property types include family villas, apartments, commercial properties, and industrial land. Corniche waterfront properties in Dammam and Al Khobar are popular with buyers. Prices in Dammam are generally competitive compared to Riyadh and Jeddah. Wasalt lists both Saudi and expatriate-friendly compound properties in the Eastern Province.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Dammam, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "8cb81676950597744185b5f942fd39da", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale", "title": "Off-Plan Properties Saudi Arabia — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt features off-plan property listings from leading Saudi developers. Off-plan projects offer buyers the opportunity to purchase properties before or during construction, often at lower prices with flexible payment plans. Major off-plan developments listed on Wasalt are located in Riyadh Vision 2030 zones, NEOM-adjacent areas, and Red Sea coastal developments. Developers offering off-plan properties on Wasalt include Saudi Binladin Group, Dar Al Arkan, Retal Urban Development, and others. Payment plans typically extend from 2 to 10 years.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "d3c59c481bb1bb33fc57c265de14113b", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale/mecca", "title": "Mecca and Medina Property Listings — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt lists properties in Mecca and Medina, Saudi Arabia's holiest cities. In Mecca, properties near Al Haram Mosque are highly sought after for religious tourism investment. Apartment towers near the Grand Mosque are available from established developers. In Medina, properties near Al Masjid Al Nabawi (Prophet's Mosque) are listed for both residential and investment purposes. Prices in both cities are influenced by proximity to the holy mosques. Wasalt ensures all Mecca and Medina listings comply with Saudi ownership rules, noting that non-Muslims are restricted from owning property in designated holy areas.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Mecca / Medina, Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
{"id": "3299eebe0a9eb2053541a18b12c68259", "source": "wasalt", "source_url": "https://wasalt.sa/en/properties-for-sale", "title": "Commercial Properties Saudi Arabia — Wasalt", "content": "Wasalt provides listings for commercial real estate across Saudi Arabia, including offices, retail spaces, warehouses, and commercial land. Office spaces are available in business districts of Riyadh (King Fahd Road, King Abdullah Financial District), Jeddah, and Dammam. Retail shops in malls, street-level units, and strip malls are listed. Industrial land and logistics warehouses are featured for the Eastern Province and logistics hubs near major highways. Prices and rental rates for commercial properties are listed in Saudi Riyals (SAR) per sqm or per year.", "doc_type": "property_listing", "location": "Saudi Arabia", "scraped_at": "2026-11-18T10:46:34.450182+00:00"}
